cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Scalaxy in your research, please cite it as follows."
title: "Scalaxy"
abstract: >-
  Multi-purpose, cloud-ready distributed database written in Common Lisp:
  consistent-hash sharding, synchronous replication, durable append-only
  log, an embedded web console, and a property-graph layer with the
  openCypher query language.
